<h2>1. Project Overview</h2>
<p>The Personal Expense Tracker and Budget Dashboard converts raw expense transactions into a clean dataset and presents monthly spending, category spending, and budget performance through an interactive dashboard.</p>
<h2>2. Objectives</h2>
<ul><li>Generate a reproducible expense dataset</li><li>Clean and quarantine invalid records</li><li>Calculate monthly and category KPIs</li><li>Identify budget breaches</li><li>Create charts and an interactive dashboard</li></ul>
<h2>3. Tools and Technologies</h2>
<p>Python, Pandas, Matplotlib, Streamlit, Altair, SQL, and Power BI DAX.</p>
<h2>4. Key Analysis and Results</h2>
<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0">
<tr><th>Indicator</th><th>Result</th></tr>
<tr><td>Total expenses</td><td>Rs. 14,01,867.73</td></tr>
<tr><td>Average monthly expense</td><td>Rs. 58,411.16</td></tr>
<tr><td>Highest spending category</td><td>Travel</td></tr>
<tr><td>Highest category amount</td><td>Rs. 4,44,970.18</td></tr>
<tr><td>Budget breach count</td><td>75</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total amount over budget</td><td>Rs. 3,61,252.90</td></tr>
<tr><td>Transaction count</td><td>626</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>5. Data Cleaning</h2>
<p>The process generated 631 raw records, removed 6 duplicate rows, quarantined 2 invalid rows, and retained 626 cleaned transactions.</p>
<h2>6. Dashboard Features</h2>
<ul><li>Year and category filters</li><li>Expense and average monthly expense KPIs</li><li>Highest category and budget breach KPIs</li><li>Monthly expense trend</li><li>Expense by category</li><li>Budget breach details</li></ul>
<h2>7. How to Run</h2>
<pre>pip install pandas matplotlib streamlit altair
python generate_expenses.py
python clean_expenses.py
python analysis_kpis_charts.py
streamlit run app/streamlit_app.py</pre>
<h2>8. Conclusion</h2>
<p>The project demonstrates a complete data analytics workflow from data generation and cleaning to KPI calculation, visualization, SQL support, and an interactive dashboard.</p>
